  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "nine-hew-levels-incinerate-and-ignition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Nine Hew levels, Incinerate and Ignition"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30047_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30047_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30047_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Nine's whole kit resolves around Hew\nHew can be leveled up by Incinerating\nIncinerate is triggered whenever the card is Exhausted\nIncinerate in the case of Hew creates you a Hew +1 level, unless it's maxed\nEphmeral, Fighting Spirit, Rei Exhaust, Fatal Strike\nAll are ways to Exhaust your Hew to level it up\nAt Max level Hew no longer Incinerates to make a Hew the same turn\nInstead it generates a new Hew at the start of the turn, so you potentially can run out\nIgnition:\nDecreases cost of the card with Ignition by 1 whenever any ally Exhausts a card"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Flash Hew = Best because you can play 4 Hews for 0 AP\nIronclad/Massacre>Extreme\nReasoning\nExtreme requires 6 cycles so you need to play Fatal\nSo +1 AP and +1 Draw required to cycle\nAt that the AP/Damage Ratio Extreme loses to Ironclad/Massacre without the Utility"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Hew Math"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
