        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\nAmazing QOL, but not always gonna matter, if the Boss doesn't spawn mobs\nE2:\n2 Vuln on demand, never gonna be bad, but good supports make it irrelevant\nE3:\nJust a damage increase, not important\nE4:\nIf this was Multiplicative it would be beyond broken, but 150% Additive isn't that much\nE5:\nPotential Levels are actually pretty great on Nine because of her high base Multipliers\nE6:\nSizable damage increase"
          }
